and gets it back without it (4.3-4.6 s). OVMF runs 9.7-11.5 s in every
variant; the module's effect there is within run-to-run noise. Stage 14
kills each boot at 12 s (scripts/test-atomic-install.sh boot_check), so
local OVMF margin is ~1.5-2 s whatever the corpus does (work order R6).

